# The delivery folder tracks the value *lists* (`deploy/.env.production`, `deploy/.env.deploy`) and
# ignores everything that holds one machine's or one deployment's own values: the `.local` files read
# on top of a list, and a `.env` beside the compose file, which compose loads for interpolation on its
# own. The development and test lists at the package root are tracked for the same reason.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
rush-logs/
*.tsbuildinfo
